# 验证：函数内不同来源的输出前缀不同，以及命令结果的回显文本。
#
# say 是 [Server] ...，命令结果是 [Server: ...]。
#
# 期望：[Server] PROBE_SAY
# 期望：[Server: Added new objective 'probe' successfully]
# 期望：[Server: Set the time to 18000]
# 期望：[Server: Game rule doFireTick has been updated to false]
# 期望：[Server: Set game difficulty to Peaceful]

--- function probe/feedback.mcfunction ---
say PROBE_SAY
scoreboard objectives add probe dummy
time set 18000
gamerule doFireTick false
difficulty peaceful

--- console ---
function probe:feedback
